    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No sweats, chills, or drowsiness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild constipation; no nausea, vomiting, or abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Evening cravings; mood low at times; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

